  "title": "Solving a Costly Automation Challenge with Smarter Robotics",
  "summary": "By Maya Dav’e, Marketing Specialist In high-volume manufacturing, even small inefficiencies can create significant cost. In one automotive application, a robotic bin picking process was experiencing scrap and damage rates of approximately 10%. The root causes were common but difficult to solve: double picks and undetected collisions. Double picks occur when a robot unintentionally grabs more than one […]",
